    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀερώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like air</i>, of the soul,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				314
			</span></i>; Astrol., of signs, <i>connected with the air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				7.26
			</span></i>; <i>light of texture</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέρινος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χρόαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.152
				</span></i>
			 (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>the airy nature,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Placit.
					2.11.2
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>full of air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				669b2
			</span></i>.</div>
